 "note": "The 39 first-round awards KDHE made on May 29, 2026, as itemized in Senator Moran's release (17 REH conversion / capital grants, 22 regional partnership grants). The itemized amounts sum to $79.01 million against the release's \"$79.1 million\"; the difference is stated, not reconciled. Greeley County Health Services and InterHab each hold two awards, so the 39 awards go to 37 organizations. Later Kansas rounds (Community Health Worker and Food is Medicine, Aug 2026; Emerging Technology, 14 providers and $16 million, and Interfacility Transport, Sept 2026) are announced on kdhe.ks.gov, which refuses automated requests, so they are not itemized here."
